# {{.Resource.TerraformName}}

Configures {{.Resource.OperationName}} for one FortiAppSec Cloud application using the static app endpoint `{{.Resource.GetPath}}`. Set `template = false` and provide `configs` to manage settings directly. Set `template = true` and omit `configs` to inherit this module from the application's attached WAF template.

Declare only one `{{.Resource.TerraformName}}` resource for an application endpoint. Template-level settings are managed by `fortiappseccloud_waf_template_{{.Resource.TypeNameSuffix | trimWAFPrefix}}`.

